---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionLabel from '../components/SectionLabel.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms" description="Shipping, returns, and warranty terms.">
  <SectionLabel text="Terms" />
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <h2>Orders and payment</h2>
    <p>Orders are placed and paid for through the store at store.underwaterstatues.com. Prices are in US dollars.</p>
    <h2>Shipping</h2>
    <p>Orders ship from Indiana, USA, usually within three business days. International orders may be subject to duties and taxes collected by the carrier.</p>
    <h2>Returns</h2>
    <p>Unused parts in original condition can be returned within 30 days for a refund of the purchase price. Contact first so a return label can be arranged.</p>
    <h2>Warranty</h2>
    <p>If a part fails under normal use, it gets replaced. Photograph it and get in touch.</p>
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>This site sets no tracking cookies. Order details are handled by Big Cartel and your payment processor under their own policies.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
